// ============================================================
// Purchasing: the thinking around the event sources, the given contexts and the seed data - sticky notes on their canvases.
//
// A note says what a decision was, what is still open, what we assume and what could go wrong, beside the cards it is about.
// Colours: green decision, yellow question, blue assumption, pink risk. Authoring metadata only: it never reaches the running application.
// ============================================================

sticky note on eventsources
  description "[DECISION] Supplier and PurchaseOrder are separate event sources: a supplier outlives every order placed with it."
  colour green
  position 1210 150
  size 270 190

sticky note on eventsources
  description "[QUESTION] Can an order be split between two suppliers, or is that two orders?"
  colour yellow
  position 1210 360
  size 270 190

sticky note on givencontexts
  description "[DECISION] A registered supplier is the only precondition every purchasing specification shares. Orders add their own events on top."
  colour green
  position 1210 150
  size 270 190

sticky note on seeddata
  description "[ASSUMPTION] Nordic Ceramics is the supplier of the whole starter catalogue. A second supplier arrives with the first real order."
  colour blue
  position 560 150
  size 270 190
